#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>Welcome to Umbrello UML Modeller.  UML lets you create models of\n"
"software systems in a standard diagramming language.  Please read the\n"
"Umbrello Handbook, available from the Help menu, to learn more about UML.</"
"p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:9
msgid "<p>Umbrello 1.1 can now import binary files from 1.0 versions.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:13
msgid ""
"<p>PHP Code Generation has been added in the 1.1rc1 release.  If you had an "
"earlier version\n"
"installed you may need to initialise it from Code menu->Add/Remove Languages."
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:18
msgid ""
"<p>The vertical lines in sequence diagrams can be resized.  Just click at "
"the bottom of\n"
"one and drag up or down.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:23
msgid ""
"<p>Sequence diagram objects can have a destructor box and be drawn as "
"actors.  Double click one for\n"
"the Properties dialogue.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:28
msgid ""
"<p>Sequence diagram objects can have their height changed using the Tab "
"option in the right click menu.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:32
msgid ""
"<p>Cut and Copy will also export the image to a PNG clipboard which can be "
"pasted into KWord\n"
"and other applications.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:37
msgid ""
"<p>Associations don't have to be in straight lines, double clicking on one "
"will create a movable\n"
"point.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:42
msgid "<p>You can turn on autosaving in the Configure Umbrello dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:46
msgid ""
"<p>Is a feature missing that you need in Umbrello? Please let us know. \n"
"Contact addresses are on the website.</p>\n"
"<p><a href=\"http://uml.sf.net/contact.php\">http://uml.sf.net/contact.php</"
"a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:52
msgid "<p>You can delete all selected objects by pressing Del or Backspace.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<p>If you've found a bug in Umbrello, please let us know. \n"
"You can submit bugs with the Bug Report tool in the Help menu.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:61
msgid ""
"<p>When using a design tool from the Work Tool Bar, pressing the Escape key "
"sets you back to the Select Tool.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:65
msgid ""
"<p>When using a design tool from the Work Tool Bar, \n"
"pressing the Shift key sets you back to the previously used Tool.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:70
msgid "<p>You can select all objects by pressing Ctrl-A.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:74
msgid ""
"<p>You can create and setup a new class using the New Class Wizard in the "
"Code menu.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

